# Cloudflare Pages response headers (airhorn-kv7m, airhorn-xnd1). This file is copied
# verbatim into dist/ by `npm run build` (public/ is the Vite publicDir) and served by
# Cloudflare Pages on every response. It takes effect when the Pages deploy is the live
# origin; the current Google Frontend origin ignores it (the production switch is Paul's
# decision - see .github/workflows/deploy-pages.yml).
#
# The CSP ships here as of airhorn-xnd1. It was withheld in kv7m because index.html
# carried two inline <script> blocks (boot watchdog, SW registration), one inline <style>
# and two inline event-handler attributes on the stylesheet link - all of which
# script-src 'self' blocks, the attributes silently and severely (the sheet's media
# never swapped). They are now external files in public/ (boot-watchdog.js,
# sw-register.js, async-css.js), and the one inline <style> - the critical first-paint
# layer - stays inline and is allowed by its sha256 below. That hash is the digest of the
# style element's text in the SERVED document, so tests/csp.test.js derives it from
# dist/index.html (a dynamic fact: the build output the browser is given, not a copy of a
# sentence). Source and build agree today; re-derive, do not hand-edit, if they diverge.
#
# Pinned by tests/pages-config.test.js and tests/csp.test.js - if you change a value, the
# pin names it.
#
# The `/*` below is the ALL-PATHS PATTERN, not a comment opener: Pages `_headers` has `#`
# comments and glob path lines, and it has no block terminator. A `*/` line is not valid
# Pages syntax - it would be an unparseable rule - so do not add one here (airhorn-xnd1 got
# this wrong first; tools/lib/static-server.mjs refuses the file by name and that is what
# caught it).
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'sha256-SzoBGjTyngQ/zkIpaFY/vwl8+X1140qzc/vw8t+tq5g='; img-src 'self' data:; media-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; worker-src 'self'; manifest-src 'self'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; object-src 'none'
